{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113337","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113337/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113337/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113337/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113337","id":3676997197,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7bKoZN","number":113337,"title":"Performance regression: SkeletonModifier3D add_child() takes 2.5+ seconds per modifier in 4.5.1 (instant in 4.1)","user":{"login":"tavurth","id":100964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDk2NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tavurth","html_url":"https://github.com/tavurth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tavurth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tavurth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tavurth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tavurth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tavurth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tavurth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tavurth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tavurth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tavurth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-11-29T18:39:45Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T10:35:25Z","closed_at":"2026-01-27T10:35:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Godot 4.1.4: Instant (no delay)\n- Godot 4.5.1: ~2.5 seconds per SkeletonModifier3D child (~10s total for 4 modifiers)\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS, Godot 4.5.1.stable, godot-cpp 4.5.1-stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nAdding SkeletonModifier3D children programmatically via `add_child()` in GDExtension has severe performance regression in 4.5 vs 4.1.\n\nEach `add_child()` call takes ~2.5 seconds in editor, even with `INTERNAL_MODE_FRONT`. Same code in 4.1 is instant.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create custom SkeletonModifier3D classes in GDExtension\n2. Programmatically create and add 4+ modifiers to Skeleton3D:\n```cpp\nskeleton->add_child(modifier, false, Node::INTERNAL_MODE_FRONT);\n```\n3. Observe 2-3 second delay per modifier (totaling 10+ seconds)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n```cpp\n// CharacterModifierBase extends SkeletonModifier3D\nspine_modifier = memnew(SpineAimModifier3D);\nspine_modifier->set_name(\"SpineAimModifier\");\nskeleton->add_child(spine_modifier); // 2.5s delay\n\nhead_modifier = memnew(HeadLookModifier3D);\nhead_modifier->set_name(\"HeadLookModifier\");\nskeleton->add_child(head_modifier); // 2.5s delay\n// ... etc\n```\n\n4.1: All 4 modifiers add instantly\n4.5: 10+ second total delay\n\n### Expected behavior\nSkeletonModifier3D `add_child()` should be instant like in 4.1","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113337/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113337/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}